{
  "_comment": [
    "A one-time, hand-authored proposal for seeding series onto an existing library.",
    "See VIE-52 for why automated resolution was cancelled.",
    "",
    "ONE TIER ONLY, by design. A series here means a story that spans several",
    "books, so that reading them out of order spoils or confuses. That is the only",
    "kind Karen asked about: she does not want to gift book 4 of something.",
    "",
    "Episodic sets were deliberately dropped rather than grouped. Baby-Sitters Club,",
    "Nate the Great, Cam Jansen, My Weird School and the like are numbered but",
    "self-contained; grouping them adds clutter and answers no question she has.",
    "",
    "totalKnown is null wherever a series is open-ended or very long. A wrong total",
    "invents missing books that Karen would go shopping for."
  ],
